    "source_pattern": "The original upper band visibly repeats gray, red and blue lobed leaves in gilded medallions. Three adjacent complete cells are the complete color period; one cell would erase the alternation. An interior red-blue-gray cycle is selected away from the initial-S ascender. Source cell spacing and brush shapes vary: this repeats one complete original three-color cycle, without claiming that all original hand-painted cycles were pixel-identical.",
