    "usage_notes": [
      "Complete original motif and color period. Original gilt/gray-green painted fields remain opaque. Original spacing and brush shapes are preserved within this chosen native period; source hand-painted cycles vary. Bars and four miter phases derive from this exact artwork, with only the audited two-column end join. These derived corners do not claim to be the original mixed-pattern page corners. Original alphabet glyphs and manuscript text are excluded.",
      "Repeats originally horizontally; use the matching rotated tile for the other axis and the supplied atlas with round fitting for frames."
